Don't look any further down.

254
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:07,160
Thirteen stab wounds.

255
00:13:06,350 --> 00:13:09,110
♪ The only thing I have left
to hold on to ♪

256
00:13:07,380 --> 00:13:09,380
His whole body's covered in wounds.

