♪ I refuse to forgive, because that is ♪

268
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:24,280
♪ The only thing I have left
to hold on to ♪

269
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:48,590
Mom...

270
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:19,210
Old Foodie.

271
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:23,120
I used to always tell you

272
00:15:24,100 --> 00:15:25,270
what you could and couldn't

273
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:26,310
eat or drink.

274
00:15:27,370 --> 00:15:28,440
I was wrong.

275
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:32,100
This is where it ends.

276
00:15:37,490 --> 00:15:39,350
I'm not going to stop you anymore.

277
00:15:40,330 --> 00:15:41,520
I'll eat with you.

278
00:15:42,630 --> 00:15:43,270
Here.

279
00:16:26,970 --> 00:16:27,610
Here.

280
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:06,520
[Hualong Funeral Home, Huangshui County]

281
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:17,200
[Deepest Condolences to
Comrade Zhao Ganzhe]

282
00:17:19,050 --> 00:17:21,470
[Police Spirit]

283
00:17:21,470 --> 00:17:23,050
[In Memoriam]

284
00:17:25,430 --> 00:17:27,950
[In Memoriam]

285
00:17:28,140 --> 00:17:29,350
Since joining the public security force,

286
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:31,410
Comrade Zhao Ganzhe devoted himself

287
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,500
wholeheartedly to his work,

288
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:34,810
faithfully fulfilled his duties,

289
00:17:34,810 --> 00:17:36,090
and upheld the law with integrity.

290
00:17:36,090 --> 00:17:38,050
He made outstanding contributions
throughout his career,

291
00:17:38,050 --> 00:17:40,140
taking part in the arrests of

292
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:41,510
more than 500 criminal suspects

293
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:44,170
and helping solve
more than 600 criminal cases,

294
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:46,730
earning one Third-Class Merit Award.

295
00:17:48,470 --> 00:17:49,310
Today,

296
00:17:49,430 --> 00:17:52,040
our dear comrade and friend

297
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:53,440
has left us.

298
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:56,260
But his unwavering spirit

299
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:57,940
in the fight against crime

300
00:17:58,590 --> 00:18:00,160
continues to inspire us.

301
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:02,960
♪ Lost in the haze of memory ♪

302
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,420
♪ Piercing straight through my heart ♪

303
00:18:10,190 --> 00:18:13,560
♪ That youthful face,
why is all that remains ♪

304
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:17,260
♪ Just a black cloth
and a line of infamy? ♪

305
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:20,690
♪ I chase after time ♪

306
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:25,080
♪ I hide myself away ♪

307
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:31,180
♪ How many times have I run and fallen,
just so ♪

308
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,310
I believe

309
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:32,780
[Graduation Certificate]

310
00:18:31,550 --> 00:18:34,210
that in the years to come,
many more outstanding young people

311
00:18:32,350 --> 00:18:35,210
♪ The belated truth
could find a place to rest ♪

312
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:35,810
will be inspired by Comrade Zhao Ganzhe's

313
00:18:35,810 --> 00:18:37,720
dedication and achievements

314
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:37,970
[Name: Li Cheng]

315
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,030
♪ Who pretends to forget? ♪

316
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:38,900
[Li Cheng] [Gender: Male]

317
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:41,240
and choose to join the ranks
of the public security force.

318
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,670
♪ Who flees in panic? ♪

319
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:46,850
Be loyal to the people

320
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:46,800
[Police Oath]

321
00:18:45,870 --> 00:18:48,640
♪ Above the abyss, who is watching? ♪

322
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,090
I pledge allegiance to the law,

323
00:18:48,090 --> 00:18:49,220
obey orders,

324
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:50,530
follow command,

325
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:54,160
♪ Under the heavens, who can escape? ♪

326
00:18:50,530 --> 00:18:51,640
strictly observe discipline,

327
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,720
safeguard secrets,

328
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,920
uphold the law impartially,

329
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:55,440
remain honest and incorruptible,

330
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,610
faithfully perform my duties,

331
00:18:56,110 --> 00:19:05,820
♪ Rise rise rise rise rise ♪

332
00:18:56,610 --> 00:18:57,900
and never fear sacrifice.

333
00:18:57,900 --> 00:19:00,310
I will devote myself wholeheartedly
to serving the people.

334
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:01,500
I am willing to dedicate myself to

335
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:03,640
the noble cause of public security.

336
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:04,830
I am willing to dedicate myself to

337
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:06,830
the noble cause of public security.

338
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:10,530
And strive tirelessly to fulfill my oath.

339
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:13,500
And strive tirelessly to fulfill my oath.

340
00:19:10,620 --> 00:19:13,560
[Police Oath]

341
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:14,310
Salute!

342
00:19:13,580 --> 00:19:14,460
[Deepest Condolences to
Comrade Zhao Ganzhe]

343
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:21,260
[Deepest Condolences to
Comrade Zhao Ganzhe]

344
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:27,820
[Police Oath]

345
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:31,880
[Public Security]

346
00:19:45,310 --> 00:19:46,240
Captain Fan, here.

347
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:48,170
Hold on, hold on. What's with this?

348
00:19:48,570 --> 00:19:49,550
What's going on with you?

349
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:50,680
Zhao just died,

350
00:19:50,850 --> 00:19:52,960
and now you're making arrangements
for your own funeral too?

351
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,160
Listen to you.

352
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:55,610
Can't you show some respect?

353
00:19:55,610 --> 00:19:56,400
I've got something I want to
discuss with you.

354
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,200
No, no, don't discuss anything.

355
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:00,290
Li Guangwen buying Chunghwa cigarettes?

356
00:20:00,290 --> 00:20:01,420
That's way too suspicious.

357
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:02,750
Way too suspicious.

358
00:20:03,380 --> 00:20:05,160
I really have serious business
to discuss with you.

359
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:07,010
Don't, don't discuss it.

360
00:20:07,250 --> 00:20:08,850
If it's official business,
not even a gold bar will do.

361
00:20:08,850 --> 00:20:11,650
And if it's personal,
you can't talk about it here.

362
00:20:12,250 --> 00:20:14,740
It's both official and personal.

363
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,160
Well, I want to

364
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:20,830
join the 3/12 Task Force.

365
00:20:23,310 --> 00:20:25,570
Officially, you're short-handed here,

366
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:26,960
especially short of someone like me—

367
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:28,510
an old hand with some experience.

368
00:20:28,510 --> 00:20:29,440
And personally,

369
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:31,940
I'm doing it for Zhao Ganzhe.

370
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,770
You expect me to just sit around
and watch from the sidelines?

371
00:20:33,770 --> 00:20:35,570
I can't sit still and do nothing.

372
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:38,510
Let me tell you,

373
00:20:38,510 --> 00:20:39,500
stop just saying "hmm" to me, okay?

374
00:20:39,500 --> 00:20:41,190
I hate it the most when you do that.

375
00:20:41,190 --> 00:20:42,790
Do you think I'm begging you?

376
00:20:44,030 --> 00:20:45,500
For this case,

377
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:47,300
Xin Jiran's family was completely ruined,

378
00:20:47,300 --> 00:20:48,740
and Zhao was stabbed over a dozen times

379
00:20:48,740 --> 00:20:50,140
and left lying in the mud.

380
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,410
I'll be retiring

381
00:20:56,050 --> 00:20:57,420
in a few years too.

382
00:20:58,610 --> 00:21:00,440
If one day, my grandson asks me,

383
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:02,460
"Grandpa, you've been a cop all your life.

384
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:04,020
How many bad guys have you caught?"

385
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:05,480
What am I supposed to say?

386
00:21:06,070 --> 00:21:07,830
Should I say I caught a lot,

387
00:21:07,860 --> 00:21:09,210
but the worst ones got away

388
00:21:09,210 --> 00:21:10,990
because Grandpa was useless

389
00:21:11,020 --> 00:21:12,740
and stupid?

390
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:14,540
You expect me to say that?

391
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:23,850
Zhao Ganzhe

392
00:21:25,250 --> 00:21:27,490
had been our friend for decades.

393
00:21:28,490 --> 00:21:30,120
He's watching both of us

394
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,680
from heaven.

395
00:21:44,570 --> 00:21:45,350
Wait...

396
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,640
You bring cigarettes

397
00:21:50,090 --> 00:21:51,250
but no lighter?

398
00:21:51,270 --> 00:21:53,050
Is this how you ask for a favor?

399
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:57,990
You... Look at you.

400
00:21:59,050 --> 00:22:00,920
I can submit the report,

401
00:22:00,940 --> 00:22:03,340
but it's up to the higher-ups
to approve it.

402
00:22:04,090 --> 00:22:05,180
Look at you.

403
00:22:05,180 --> 00:22:07,710
You just have to give me a hard time,
don't you?

404
00:22:08,130 --> 00:22:09,030
Don't worry.

405
00:22:09,410 --> 00:22:11,140
Once I've joined the task force,

406
00:22:11,140 --> 00:22:12,930
I'll follow your every order.

407
00:22:13,490 --> 00:22:14,630
Close the door.

408
00:22:15,410 --> 00:22:17,140
Submit the report for me first.

409
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:19,510
Close the door on your way out.

410
00:22:38,620 --> 00:22:39,740
Thank you.

411
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,440
Li Cheng, over here.

412
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:52,400
Here you go.

413
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:56,990
Thanks.

414
00:22:58,250 --> 00:23:01,710
I heard you ranked second in the province
for the written exam.

415
00:23:02,270 --> 00:23:03,010
Impressive.

416
00:23:03,050 --> 00:23:05,050
I'm with the Legal Affairs Brigade,

417
00:23:05,230 --> 00:23:07,470
We're basically new recruits
from the same intake.

418
00:23:07,470 --> 00:23:08,590
Let's keep in touch.

419
00:23:08,590 --> 00:23:09,510
If there's anything we don't understand,

420
00:23:09,510 --> 00:23:10,750
we can ask each other,

421
00:23:10,770 --> 00:23:11,470
right?

422
00:23:12,090 --> 00:23:13,220
That's a great idea.

423
00:23:13,300 --> 00:23:14,340
Before I joined,

424
00:23:14,360 --> 00:23:15,800
I was worried that the senior officers
might push me around.

425
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:17,560
We may be in different departments,

426
00:23:17,560 --> 00:23:18,720
but if we stick together
and look out for each other,

427
00:23:18,720 --> 00:23:20,470
I won't have anything to worry about.

428
00:23:20,470 --> 00:23:21,510
Don't worry.

429
00:23:21,530 --> 00:23:22,590
Everyone's busy.

430
00:23:22,620 --> 00:23:23,930
No one's going to push you around.

431
00:23:23,930 --> 00:23:25,510
I'm not worried about being pushed around.

432
00:23:25,510 --> 00:23:28,350
I'm just afraid of making mistakes
and getting chewed out.

433
00:23:28,350 --> 00:23:30,180
I hear the leadership this term

434
00:23:30,180 --> 00:23:31,400
is very strict.

435
00:23:31,420 --> 00:23:32,210
Is that so?

436
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,500
Li Cheng.

437
00:23:33,690 --> 00:23:34,520
Sen.

438
00:23:35,200 --> 00:23:36,400
Keep it up. Work hard.

439
00:23:41,420 --> 00:23:43,720
Those guys are from
the Criminal Investigation Brigade, right?

440
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,180
You seem to know them well.

441
00:23:46,030 --> 00:23:47,030
Well, I know them.

442
00:23:47,550 --> 00:23:49,710
Are your parents in the police force?

443
00:23:51,190 --> 00:23:53,430
My mom... She's a top detective.

444
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:55,140
Li Cheng.

445
00:23:56,320 --> 00:23:58,000
Captain Fan, Mr. Li.

446
00:23:58,030 --> 00:23:58,700
Eat up.

447
00:23:58,720 --> 00:23:59,920
We're going out after you finish.

448
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:00,850
Look at you.

449
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,680
It's okay. Take your time.

450
00:24:02,700 --> 00:24:03,700
I'm already done.

451
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:05,920
Alright.

452
00:24:05,980 --> 00:24:09,440
Cheng, you see, Fan just can't stand it
when people eat slowly.

453
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:20,770
How does it feel on your first day?

454
00:24:22,410 --> 00:24:25,140
I was thrilled the moment
I put on the new uniform,

455
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:28,120
but once I got to the station,
I felt strangely calm.

456
00:24:28,120 --> 00:24:30,920
It's like there's something
weighing on my heart.

457
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:32,720
Straighten your back.

458
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,180
The case isn't closed yet.

459
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:35,880
We can only give Zhao justice

460
00:24:35,880 --> 00:24:37,350
by catching the killer.

461
00:24:37,370 --> 00:24:38,020
Got it?

462
00:24:38,340 --> 00:24:39,450
Yes, Captain Fan.

463
00:24:42,090 --> 00:24:43,990
Where are we going now?

464
00:24:44,500 --> 00:24:46,140
To see an old friend of ours.

465
00:24:48,870 --> 00:24:49,830
Xin Jiran?

466
00:24:50,660 --> 00:24:51,990
Quick on the uptake.

467
00:24:52,010 --> 00:24:55,070
No wonder Zhao insisted on
bringing him to the brigade.

468
00:24:56,120 --> 00:24:58,320
No wonder Mr. Li is coming along as well.

469
00:24:59,030 --> 00:25:02,630
We still haven't figured out
the identity of the fake Song Laifu?

470
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:03,630
This guy

471
00:25:03,650 --> 00:25:04,870
keeps to himself.

472
00:25:05,050 --> 00:25:06,180
No criminal record,

473
00:25:06,210 --> 00:25:08,330
and he doesn't match any
missing-person reports.

474
00:25:08,330 --> 00:25:10,460
I doubt he has any relatives or friends.

475
00:25:10,460 --> 00:25:12,160
Xin Jiran couldn't have killed him.

476
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:13,300
Of course I know.

477
00:25:13,710 --> 00:25:15,840
We've verified everything he told us.

478
00:25:15,890 --> 00:25:18,650
Does he know about Master?

479
00:25:18,670 --> 00:25:21,200
He's been in isolation
for treatment lately.

480
00:25:22,820 --> 00:25:23,800
Then we...

481
00:25:23,820 --> 00:25:25,560
Right. We're going today

482
00:25:26,230 --> 00:25:27,560
to tell him about it.

483
00:25:40,980 --> 00:25:41,790
Xin,

484
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:43,250
enjoying your meal?

485
00:25:45,390 --> 00:25:46,760
Fifty yuan a day.

486
00:25:47,010 --> 00:25:48,410
It'd be a waste not to eat.

487
00:25:50,170 --> 00:25:51,060
Mr. Xin.

488
00:25:55,330 --> 00:25:57,130
I see you got your new uniform on.

489
00:25:58,700 --> 00:25:59,730
Congratulations.

490
00:25:59,730 --> 00:26:00,490
Thank you.

491
00:26:03,230 --> 00:26:04,380
How are you feeling?

492
00:26:04,410 --> 00:26:05,440
I've been fine for days.

493
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:07,370
I wanted to be discharged days ago,

494
00:26:07,520 --> 00:26:08,920
but they wouldn't let me.

495
00:26:09,250 --> 00:26:10,890
Regarding the Song Laifu case,

496
00:26:10,890 --> 00:26:13,760
you've been cleared as a suspect for now.

497
00:26:14,180 --> 00:26:16,420
But you're still involved in the case,

498
00:26:16,420 --> 00:26:19,200
so you can't just leave whenever you want.

499
00:26:20,090 --> 00:26:21,480
Don't rush to get discharged.

500
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:23,110
Your health comes first.

501
00:26:27,570 --> 00:26:29,900
Now that you've joined the regular force,

502
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:33,330
you sound so official.

503
00:26:37,760 --> 00:26:39,020
Learned that from him?

504
00:26:39,030 --> 00:26:41,030
What's wrong with learning from me?

505
00:26:45,380 --> 00:26:46,640
For getting promoted,

506
00:26:46,680 --> 00:26:48,140
learning from him is fine.

507
00:26:48,430 --> 00:26:49,830
But for everything else,

508
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:51,970
you should stick with Zhao Ganzhe.

509
00:26:52,780 --> 00:26:55,220
How come the three of you
showed up together?

510
00:26:55,220 --> 00:26:56,420
Where's Zhao Ganzhe?

511
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:11,580
What happened to Zhao Ganzhe?

512
00:27:30,650 --> 00:27:32,050
My master...

513
00:27:34,380 --> 00:27:35,080
He's gone.

514
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:58,020
Was it an accident,

515
00:27:58,710 --> 00:28:00,640
or did it happen in the line of duty?

516
00:28:00,830 --> 00:28:02,090
It wasn't an accident.

517
00:28:03,850 --> 00:28:04,900
Who did it?

518
00:28:05,810 --> 00:28:06,610
We don't know.

519
00:28:08,840 --> 00:28:10,500
Is it related to the 3/12 Case?

520
00:28:15,590 --> 00:28:17,330
Is it related to Han Pinmu?

521
00:28:18,580 --> 00:28:19,590
Mr. Xin,

522
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:22,480
we'll definitely seek justice for him.

523
00:28:23,930 --> 00:28:25,440
That's all I can say.

524
00:28:38,740 --> 00:28:40,080
It's hard on everyone

525
00:28:40,110 --> 00:28:42,040
when something like this happens.

526
00:28:42,310 --> 00:28:43,510
But we still

527
00:28:43,690 --> 00:28:44,930
have to move forward.

528
00:28:45,440 --> 00:28:46,330
Li Cheng.

529
00:28:47,850 --> 00:28:48,610
Captain Fan.

530
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:51,200
Do you still want to transfer
to the Criminal Investigation Brigade?

531
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:51,880
I do.

532
00:28:53,060 --> 00:28:53,640
Okay.

533
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:55,850
I'll have a word with Wang Zhengcao

534
00:28:55,850 --> 00:28:57,400
and Chief Tu

535
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:59,380
and get you transferred over.

536
00:29:00,070 --> 00:29:02,800
Wasn't it supposed to be
a temporary assignment?

537
00:29:03,050 --> 00:29:05,180
If you'd just revealed information
to Xin Jiran

538
00:29:05,180 --> 00:29:07,370
that you shouldn't have,

539
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:09,250
it would've been a temporary assignment.

540
00:29:09,250 --> 00:29:11,010
Good thing you kept your mouth shut.

541
00:29:11,010 --> 00:29:12,270
Consider that a little test

542
00:29:12,270 --> 00:29:14,200
from me.

543
00:29:15,150 --> 00:29:15,810
You passed.

544
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,970
So that's why

545
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:19,170
you brought me here?

546
00:29:19,190 --> 00:29:21,570
Talented people are in demand everywhere.

547
00:29:21,570 --> 00:29:23,970
And I'm better
at snatching them than Zhao.

548
00:29:24,530 --> 00:29:26,650
Thank you for your trust, Captain Fan.

549
00:29:26,650 --> 00:29:28,850
Come on, let me formally introduce you.

550
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:30,610
This is Li Guangwen,

551
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,670
your direct supervisor on the task force.

552
00:29:32,670 --> 00:29:34,410
Follow his orders for everything.

553
00:29:34,410 --> 00:29:35,140
Yes, sir!

554
00:29:35,520 --> 00:29:36,480
No, no, no.

555
00:29:36,570 --> 00:29:38,200
Forget about this "supervisor" stuff.

556
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:39,650
Listen, kid,

557
00:29:39,790 --> 00:29:41,900
from now on, we are partners.

558
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:48,610
So many.

559
00:29:49,510 --> 00:29:51,590
Are these all the files for the 3/12 Case?

560
00:29:51,590 --> 00:29:52,240
Yes.

561
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:56,720
[Criminal Investigation Case Files]

562
00:29:56,770 --> 00:29:57,220
[Case Name: "3/12" Series of
Robbery-Murder Cases]

563
00:29:57,220 --> 00:29:58,220
[Case Filed by: Xin Jiran]
[Reviewed by: Fan Jie]

564
00:29:59,980 --> 00:30:00,600
[Leads]

565
00:30:00,630 --> 00:30:01,300
[Meet at Happiness Park at 12:00.
Come alone.]

566
00:30:01,330 --> 00:30:01,830
[Acquainted. The two are on bad terms.]

567
00:30:38,180 --> 00:30:39,010
Li Cheng

568
00:30:39,010 --> 00:30:41,540
is kind of a half-party to this case.

569
00:30:41,580 --> 00:30:42,920
So, if anyone has anything to say,

570
00:30:41,690 --> 00:30:44,020
[Huangshui Public Security]

571
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:44,050
let's speak freely.

572
00:30:44,070 --> 00:30:46,070
This is also a good chance for us

573
00:30:44,140 --> 00:30:51,710
[Rotating Red Banner]

574
00:30:46,070 --> 00:30:47,670
to go over Zhao's case again.

575
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:49,380
Zhang Chengguo's phone signal

576
00:30:49,380 --> 00:30:50,480
last appeared

577
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:51,790
at Happiness Park.

578
00:30:51,810 --> 00:30:52,610
The suspect

579
00:30:52,610 --> 00:30:54,440
first sent you a text,

580
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:56,480
then called Han Pinmu,

581
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:58,330
and destroyed his SIM card afterwards.

582
00:30:58,330 --> 00:30:59,640
According to Han Pinmu,

583
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,180
he thought it was a scam call.

584
00:31:01,180 --> 00:31:02,480
The person on the phone asked,

585
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:03,570
"Are you home yet?"

586
00:31:03,610 --> 00:31:05,110
Han Pinmu just casually replied,

587
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:06,240
"I'll be right there,"

588
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:07,070
and hung up.

589
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:08,770
Is that true?

590
00:31:09,860 --> 00:31:10,960
He did receive a call

591
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:12,570
that night,

592
00:31:12,620 --> 00:31:14,480
and that was exactly what he said.

593
00:31:16,410 --> 00:31:17,000
Hello?

594
00:31:17,610 --> 00:31:18,740
I'll be right there.

595
00:31:19,590 --> 00:31:21,290
But I don't believe a word

596
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,640
of Han Pinmu's explanation.

597
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:24,160
A drink bottle was found at the scene

598
00:31:24,050 --> 00:31:26,230
[Pomelo Sparkling Water]

599
00:31:24,180 --> 00:31:26,400
with Han Pinmu's saliva
and fingerprints on it.

600
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:28,450
This shows someone wanted
to frame Han Pinmu,

601
00:31:28,450 --> 00:31:29,440
because at the time of the crime,

602
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:30,900
he was right in front of us.

603
00:31:31,010 --> 00:31:32,960
Since Han Pinmu could predict

604
00:31:32,960 --> 00:31:34,480
someone was going to frame him,

605
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:35,830
it proves

606
00:31:35,860 --> 00:31:37,490
he knew the caller.

607
00:31:37,510 --> 00:31:39,070
But he won't admit it,

608
00:31:39,090 --> 00:31:40,880
and we have no way to prove it.

609
00:31:41,460 --> 00:31:42,480
What I find most baffling

610
00:31:42,480 --> 00:31:44,290
is this point Li Cheng raised.

611
00:31:44,330 --> 00:31:45,570
If Han Pinmu knew

612
00:31:45,570 --> 00:31:46,660
the other party was going to frame him

613
00:31:46,660 --> 00:31:47,750
by killing

614
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:48,880
a police officer,

615
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:49,900
then clearly

616
00:31:49,900 --> 00:31:51,950
they're mortal enemies.

617
00:31:51,980 --> 00:31:54,910
But since Han Pinmu knew
the other party's identity,

618
00:31:55,010 --> 00:31:55,850
why didn't he use

619
00:31:55,850 --> 00:31:57,260
our police force

620
00:31:57,280 --> 00:31:58,740
to deal with this problem?

621
00:32:00,320 --> 00:32:01,620
Maybe

622
00:32:01,750 --> 00:32:03,240
the other party has something

623
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,550
on Han Pinmu.

624
00:32:04,940 --> 00:32:06,120
For example,

625
00:32:06,150 --> 00:32:09,280
solid proof of Han Pinmu's involvement
in the 3/12 Case.

626
00:32:10,530 --> 00:32:11,460
Exactly.

627
00:32:12,270 --> 00:32:13,820
But the other party was certain

628
00:32:13,820 --> 00:32:15,860
that if Han Pinmu was caught by us,

629
00:32:15,890 --> 00:32:17,670
even if sentenced to death,

630
00:32:17,700 --> 00:32:19,880
he still wouldn't reveal his identity.

631
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:20,730
Why?

632
00:32:21,740 --> 00:32:22,940
For the same reason.

633
00:32:24,620 --> 00:32:25,450
Yeah.

634
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:28,680
So what could that leverage be?

635
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:32,350
Han Pinmu would rather die than tell us.

636
00:32:34,550 --> 00:32:35,330
Li Cheng,

637
00:32:35,450 --> 00:32:37,580
you know Han Pinmu better than anyone.

638
00:32:37,670 --> 00:32:39,130
Can you think of anything?

639
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:43,760
I have no idea.

640
00:32:46,360 --> 00:32:47,550
Were there any other clues

641
00:32:47,550 --> 00:32:49,180
at Master's crime scene?

642
00:32:49,380 --> 00:32:50,180
Very few.

643
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:51,440
The park has 4 entrances,

644
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:53,420
but there's only surveillance
at the main entrance,

645
00:32:53,420 --> 00:32:55,220
and it didn't capture anything.

646
00:32:56,380 --> 00:32:57,830
Other than a drink bottle,

647
00:32:57,830 --> 00:32:59,960
we only found half a sneaker print.

648
00:33:00,600 --> 00:33:01,030
[Pomelo Sparkling Water]

649
00:33:01,420 --> 00:33:03,290
Experts from the provincial capital
determined that

650
00:33:03,290 --> 00:33:05,310
the suspect is likely an adult male,

651
00:33:05,310 --> 00:33:07,880
between 1.80 and 1.85 meters tall,

652
00:33:07,900 --> 00:33:10,200
weighing around 75 kilograms,

653
00:33:10,200 --> 00:33:11,270
with a slim build.

654
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,660
He was inexperienced.

655
00:33:13,090 --> 00:33:15,000
The two of them struggled,

656
00:33:15,220 --> 00:33:17,440
and he stabbed Captain Zhao 13 times,

657
00:33:17,970 --> 00:33:19,430
three of which were fatal.

658
00:33:19,830 --> 00:33:22,640
Captain Zhao's service weapon, wallet, ID,

659
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:24,180
and other belongings were all left behind,

660
00:33:24,180 --> 00:33:25,580
which also suggests

661
00:33:25,600 --> 00:33:27,110
the suspect was panicked.

662
00:33:28,950 --> 00:33:29,930
By the way,

663
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:33,040
judging from the distribution
of the stab wounds,

664
00:33:33,290 --> 00:33:35,610
the suspect is very likely

665
00:33:35,660 --> 00:33:36,840
left-handed.

666
00:33:38,940 --> 00:33:39,810
Are you sure?

667
00:33:39,810 --> 00:33:41,740
Not sure. It's just a possibility.

668
00:33:44,310 --> 00:33:46,170
Nice, good kiting there.

669
00:33:49,090 --> 00:33:51,060
There's one person
who knows all three of us—

670
00:33:51,060 --> 00:33:52,120
me, Han Pinmu,and Zhang Chengguo,

671
00:33:52,120 --> 00:33:53,400
and he's

672
00:33:54,130 --> 00:33:55,150
left-handed.

673
00:33:56,050 --> 00:33:57,750
[Longteng Internet Cafe]

674
00:34:01,070 --> 00:34:02,460
[Longteng Internet Cafe]

675
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:15,699
Sun Qiang.

676
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:18,409
C-Cheng?

677
00:34:18,429 --> 00:34:20,139
What brings you two here?

678
00:34:20,230 --> 00:34:20,960
We're from the police.

679
00:34:20,330 --> 00:34:21,110
[Police] [Li Cheng]

680
00:34:20,980 --> 00:34:22,840
I just need to ask you a few things.

681
00:34:25,530 --> 00:34:27,570
I knew you were no ordinary guy.

682
00:34:27,699 --> 00:34:29,560
Let's go u-upstairs then.

683
00:34:29,590 --> 00:34:30,389
Second floor.

684
00:34:34,060 --> 00:34:34,750
Let's go.

685
00:34:35,060 --> 00:34:36,920
It was a total mess here
a couple of days ago.

686
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:37,900
Look at this.

687
00:34:38,219 --> 00:34:40,110
You are my first batch of guests.

688
00:34:40,130 --> 00:34:42,900
Absolutely super VIPs.

689
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:44,300
Have a seat. Come on.

690
00:34:45,659 --> 00:34:46,739
[VIP 1]

691
00:34:46,190 --> 00:34:47,670
Cheng, what do you want to drink?

692
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:50,080
[Alliance Brothers]

693
00:34:47,670 --> 00:34:49,020
I have some in the fridge.

694
00:34:49,020 --> 00:34:50,219
No need.

695
00:34:50,239 --> 00:34:52,440
Sit down. I have a few questions for you.

696
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:59,000
[Alliance Brothers]

697
00:35:03,530 --> 00:35:04,930
What do you think, Cheng?

698
00:35:05,170 --> 00:35:06,500
With this environment,

699
00:35:06,670 --> 00:35:07,400
once I open,

700
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:09,340
I'll definitely take half the customers
from Benteng Internet Cafe.

701
00:35:09,340 --> 00:35:10,300
Believe it or not.

702
00:35:10,300 --> 00:35:12,130
This internet cafe is quite big.

703
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,490
How much did you invest?

704
00:35:13,490 --> 00:35:14,550
Must be a lot, huh?

705
00:35:15,210 --> 00:35:16,170
Not bad.

706
00:35:16,830 --> 00:35:17,850
From a security guard

707
00:35:17,850 --> 00:35:19,690
to a big boss.

708
00:35:19,830 --> 00:35:21,830
Introduce me to this kind of job too.

709
00:35:21,990 --> 00:35:22,510
Come on.

710
00:35:22,510 --> 00:35:24,010
Have you been lucky lately?

711
00:35:24,010 --> 00:35:25,270
Made it from gambling?

712
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:25,960
Look at you.

713
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:26,670
Look at you.

714
00:35:27,330 --> 00:35:29,470
You two are just making fun of me.

715
00:35:29,510 --> 00:35:31,420
I'm just a minor shareholder.

716
00:35:32,530 --> 00:35:34,530
The financial backer doesn't want
to show his face.

717
00:35:34,530 --> 00:35:36,650
Actually, I didn't invest much at all.

718
00:35:36,650 --> 00:35:37,900
Who's the backer?

719
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:38,840
Li Zhengbin?

720
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:41,000
Does he appreciate you that much,

721
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:43,020
or do you have something on him?

722
00:35:44,190 --> 00:35:45,120
You...

723
00:35:46,020 --> 00:35:48,130
My mom won the lottery, okay?

724
00:35:50,380 --> 00:35:51,840
We're not strangers.

725
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,150
What's this about?

726
00:35:53,230 --> 00:35:55,230
Are you from the police
or the commerce bureau?

727
00:35:55,230 --> 00:35:56,260
Don't scare me.

728
00:35:56,260 --> 00:35:57,590
I'm easily frightened.

729
00:35:59,030 --> 00:35:59,960
Have some water.

730
00:36:07,010 --> 00:36:08,140
How did you get that?

731
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:10,110
From scraping therapy.

732
00:36:10,110 --> 00:36:11,170
Scraping therapy?

733
00:36:11,260 --> 00:36:12,660
Where did you get it done?

734
00:36:12,700 --> 00:36:14,360
You got beaten up, didn't you?

735
00:36:21,570 --> 00:36:22,450
Look.

736
00:36:23,310 --> 00:36:25,040
You still think I got beaten up?

737
00:36:25,380 --> 00:36:26,130
Satisfied?

738
00:36:27,330 --> 00:36:27,970
Alright,

739
00:36:28,640 --> 00:36:30,170
let's get down to business.

740
00:36:30,210 --> 00:36:32,230
From 11:00 p.m. on the 29th of this month

741
00:36:32,230 --> 00:36:33,980
to 1:00 a.m. on the 30th,

742
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:34,860
where were you?

743
00:36:34,900 --> 00:36:35,460
Right here.

744
00:36:35,460 --> 00:36:36,670
Think before you speak.

745
00:36:36,670 --> 00:36:37,550
You memorized it pretty well.

746
00:36:37,550 --> 00:36:39,340
I've never left here these past few days.

747
00:36:39,340 --> 00:36:40,510
I keep an eye on the renovation
during the day

748
00:36:40,510 --> 00:36:41,610
and play games at night.

749
00:36:41,610 --> 00:36:42,370
Alright then.

750
00:36:42,370 --> 00:36:43,850
Pull up your game match records

751
00:36:43,850 --> 00:36:45,120
and show me.

752
00:36:46,640 --> 00:36:48,650
But I might have been sleeping too.

753
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:49,840
Can anyone prove it?

754
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:50,590
No.

755
00:36:51,260 --> 00:36:52,590
I was the only one here.

756
00:36:53,330 --> 00:36:54,830
Just you alone?

757
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:58,720
Then these security cameras
won't be needed, huh?

758
00:36:59,080 --> 00:37:00,410
They weren't turned on.

759
00:37:01,240 --> 00:37:02,280
We're not open for business yet.

760
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:04,500
Turning them on would waste electricity
and hard drive space, right?

761
00:37:04,500 --> 00:37:05,470
Sun Qiang,

762
00:37:05,530 --> 00:37:07,650
so you're saying there's no one
or no evidence

763
00:37:07,650 --> 00:37:09,400
to prove what you said?

764
00:37:10,130 --> 00:37:10,830
Wait.

765
00:37:11,940 --> 00:37:13,820
What exactly happened?

766
00:37:13,940 --> 00:37:14,790
Cheng, Cheng.

767
00:37:15,530 --> 00:37:16,900
W-What's going on?

768
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,620
I'm sweating.

769
00:37:22,710 --> 00:37:24,170
What shoe size do you wear?

770
00:37:25,890 --> 00:37:27,530
When will you return them to me?

771
00:37:27,530 --> 00:37:28,480
What's the rush?

772
00:37:28,510 --> 00:37:29,710
Are you a centipede or something?

773
00:37:29,710 --> 00:37:30,770
Why would you need that many shoes?

774
00:37:29,990 --> 00:37:31,390
[Longteng Internet Cafe]

775
00:37:30,790 --> 00:37:31,480
Sign here.

776
00:37:42,530 --> 00:37:43,620
And this pair too.

777
00:37:45,660 --> 00:37:46,440
Take them off.

778
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:48,340
What are you grunting for?
Just take them off.

779
00:37:48,340 --> 00:37:49,050
Okay.

780
00:37:49,080 --> 00:37:49,960
Got a lighter?

781
00:37:50,370 --> 00:37:51,540
Yes, yes.

782
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:53,200
Wait a minute.

783
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:04,460
This is just...

784
00:38:06,970 --> 00:38:08,680
It was also you

785
00:38:08,710 --> 00:38:10,170
who burned down Han Pinmu's
internet cafe, right?

786
00:38:10,170 --> 00:38:11,280
Cheng.

787
00:38:12,110 --> 00:38:14,320
Are you playing Truth or Dare with me?

788
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:15,510
What do you mean "also"?

789
00:38:15,510 --> 00:38:17,370
What did I do to deserve an "also"?

790
00:38:18,530 --> 00:38:19,490
See that?

791
00:38:19,940 --> 00:38:21,650
Over there. And there.

792
00:38:21,750 --> 00:38:23,800
[Longteng Internet Cafe]

793
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:23,930
And opposite Han Pinmu's internet cafe.

794
00:38:23,930 --> 00:38:25,060
Our county

795
00:38:25,090 --> 00:38:27,130
had 56 new cameras installed last month.

796
00:38:27,130 --> 00:38:28,170
Riverside Square,

797
00:38:28,170 --> 00:38:29,150
Shatou Park,

798
00:38:29,150 --> 00:38:29,980
and Happiness Park

799
00:38:29,980 --> 00:38:30,920
all have cameras now.

800
00:38:30,920 --> 00:38:32,400
So whether you're playing Truth

801
00:38:32,400 --> 00:38:33,350
or Dare,

802
00:38:33,380 --> 00:38:34,710
it makes no difference.

803
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:35,560
But...

804
00:38:35,710 --> 00:38:37,010
Don't go too far out of town for a while.

805
00:38:37,010 --> 00:38:38,440
We may need to reach you at any time.

806
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:38,860
Bro.

807
00:38:38,860 --> 00:38:40,480
Bro, tell me about it. Hey...

808
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:42,080
What exactly happened?

809
00:38:42,420 --> 00:38:43,070
Bro!

810
00:38:44,170 --> 00:38:46,810
[Longteng Internet Cafe]

811
00:38:50,260 --> 00:38:51,630
Not bad, kid.

812
00:38:52,460 --> 00:38:54,040
You almost fooled me too.

813
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:55,190
I was wondering

814
00:38:55,210 --> 00:38:57,240
when you started smoking.

815
00:38:58,110 --> 00:39:00,100
I'm just learning from you, Mr. Li.

816
00:39:00,130 --> 00:39:01,660
Adapting to the situation.

817
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:04,180
I like the sound of that.

818
00:39:05,590 --> 00:39:08,450
But I just saw him light the fire
with his right hand.

819
00:39:09,150 --> 00:39:10,220
This Sun Qiang

820
00:39:10,660 --> 00:39:12,180
is either really innocent,

821
00:39:12,180 --> 00:39:14,220
or he's deep enough

822
00:39:14,250 --> 00:39:16,070
to have guarded against this.

823
00:39:17,340 --> 00:39:18,380
Either way,

824
00:39:18,410 --> 00:39:19,540
let's test him first

825
00:39:19,650 --> 00:39:20,970
and see how he reacts.

826
00:39:22,050 --> 00:39:23,150
Good thinking.

827
00:39:25,860 --> 00:39:27,790
They were obviously bluffing you.

828
00:39:28,500 --> 00:39:29,630
I'm not that stupid.

829
00:39:30,420 --> 00:39:31,300
Did you go or not?

830
00:39:31,300 --> 00:39:32,030
I didn't.

831
00:39:33,430 --> 00:39:35,760
Sun Qiang has been acting strange lately.

832
00:39:35,770 --> 00:39:37,350
We have to keep a close eye on him

833
00:39:37,350 --> 00:39:38,650
to figure this all out.
